{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771169636362,"sessionID":"ses_39e11aa4effeYeEII0I39dpUo4","part":{"id":"prt_c61ee980f001ZZ1q7eP6re2WkG","sessionID":"ses_39e11aa4effeYeEII0I39dpUo4","messageID":"msg_c61ee6aab001ICucCNszfbxhDR","type":"tool","callID":"call_31ad347470d5432ba56ad115","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"subagent_type":"explore","description":"Analyze implementation status","prompt":"Comprehensively explore the src/ directory to understand what has already been implemented.\n\nCheck:\n1. src/lib/ - all utility and core logic files (simulation.ts, phase.ts, flux.ts, interaction.ts, etc.)\n2. src/components/ - all React components (CanvasGrid.tsx, GridInteraction.tsx, Game.tsx, etc.)\n3. src/types/ - type definitions\n4. src/hooks/ - custom hooks\n5. src/styles/ - styling files\n\nFor each file you find, provide:\n- File name and path\n- Brief description of what it implements\n- Any missing functionality or TODOs\n- How complete it appears\n\nUse glob and read tools to examine all files. Be thorough - check every directory and file."},"output":"task_id: ses_39e1167dcffemiWZYyUcJM0KCN (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my comprehensive exploration of the src/ directory, here is a detailed report of what has been implemented:\n\n---\n\n## COMPREHENSIVE SRC/ DIRECTORY ANALYSIS\n\n### 1. TYPES (`src/types/index.ts`)\n**File:** `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts`\n\n**Description:** Complete type definitions for the entire application. Defines all core types, interfaces, and configuration structures.\n\n**Implemented Types:**\n- `GridType` - 2D number array for cell states\n- `GamePhase` - 'PLANNING' | 'COUNTDOWN' | 'RUNNING' | 'FINISHED'\n- `InteractionMode` - 'DRAW' | 'ERASE'\n- `TransitionState` - 'PLAYING' | 'FADING_OUT' | 'INTERSTITIAL' | 'FADING_IN' | 'READY'\n- `CellCluster` & `TrackedCluster` - Pattern tracking structures\n- `RuleSet` - Game rules configuration\n- `SimulationState` - Core simulation state\n- `FluxState` - Resource management state\n- `LevelConfig` & `LevelProgression` - Level system\n- `ScoringConfig` & `ScoreState` - Scoring system\n- `TransitionConfig` - Transition animation settings\n- `ExpertSettings` - Expert configuration (movementDetection, scoring, levelGeneration, gridSizing, audio)\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- Type definitions are complete but many features are not yet implemented in the logic (cluster tracking, scoring, levels, transitions, audio)\n- No TODOs found\n\n**Completeness:** 100% (types are complete, implementation is missing some features)\n\n---\n\n### 2. LIB - CORE LOGIC FILES\n\n#### `src/lib/simulation.ts` (138 lines)\n**Description:** Core Game of Life simulation engine with Conway rules and grid management.\n\n**Implemented Functions:**\n- `createGrid(rows, cols)` - Initialize empty grid\n- `countNeighbors(grid, row, col)` - Count live neighbors with toroidal wrapping\n- `applyRules(grid, rules)` - Apply game rules, return new grid with cell ages\n- `stepSimulation(state)` - Advance simulation one generation\n- `setCell(grid, row, col, age)` - Set individual cell\n- `clearGrid(rows, cols)` - Reset grid to empty\n- `randomFill(grid, density)` - Randomly populate grid\n- `countAliveCells(grid)` - Count all live cells\n- `isGridEmpty(grid)` - Check if grid is empty\n- `getGridSize(preset)` - Get preset dimensions\n- `CONWAY_RULES` constant and `GRID_SIZE_PRESETS`\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No pattern detection or analysis\n- No custom rule sets beyond Conway\n- No cluster tracking logic\n- No pattern libraries\n\n**Completeness:** 95% (simulation logic complete, advanced features missing)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (322 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/phase.ts` (166 lines)\n**Description:** Game phase state management with reducer pattern for transitions.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- `PhaseState` interface with countdown, timer, blockers\n- `PhaseAction` union type for all phase transitions\n- `canTransition(from, to)` - Validate phase transitions\n- `getBlockers(currentPhase, hasCells)` - Check interaction blockers\n- `createInitialPhaseState()` - Initialize state\n- `phaseReducer(state, action, hasCells)` - Handle all phase actions\n\n**Phases:** PLANNING → COUNTDOWN → RUNNING → FINISHED → PLANNING\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No actual integration with simulation timer\n- No interstitial phase logic implemented\n- No transition animations\n\n**Completeness:** 80% (phase logic complete, not fully integrated)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (236 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/flux.ts` (57 lines)\n**Description:** Resource/Flux management system for placing and removing cells.\n\n**Implemented Functions:**\n- `createInitialFluxState(initialFlux)` - Initialize flux\n- `canPlaceCell(flux)` - Check if placement allowed\n- `canRefundCell(phase)` - Check if removal refunds flux (PLANNING only)\n- `placeCell(flux)` - Decrement flux, track placed count\n- `removeCell(flux, phase)` - Increment flux, track removed count\n- `resetFlux(initialFlux)` - Reset to initial state\n- `getFluxColor(flux)` - Return color indicator (green/yellow/orange/red)\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No flux regeneration over time\n- No dynamic flux based on level\n- No bonus flux mechanics\n\n**Completeness:** 90% (core flux management complete)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (184 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/interaction.ts` (60 lines)\n**Description:** Grid interaction utilities for mouse/touch coordinate conversion.\n\n**Implemented Functions:**\n- `getCellFromEvent(event, canvas, numRows, numCols)` - Convert mouse/touch to grid coords\n- `isWithinBounds(row, col, numRows, numCols)` - Boundary checking\n- `createInitialInteractionState()` - Initialize interaction state\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No drag-to-paint functionality\n- No multi-touch support\n- No keyboard shortcuts\n\n**Completeness:** 70% (basic interaction complete, advanced features missing)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Basic (97 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/state.ts` (114 lines)\n**Description:** Redux-like state management utilities (action creators, reducers, localStorage helpers).\n\n**Implemented Functions:**\n- `createActionCreator(type)` - Create actions without payload\n- `createActionCreatorWithPayload(type)` - Create actions with payload\n- `createReducer(initialState, actionHandlers)` - Create reducer\n- `createAsyncAction(name)` - Create async action creators (request/success/failure)\n- `combineReducers(reducers)` - Combine multiple reducers\n- `dispatchMultiple(dispatch, actions)` - Batch dispatch\n- `saveToLocalStorage(key, value)` - Persist state\n- `loadFromLocalStorage(key, defaultValue)` - Load persisted state\n- `removeFromLocalStorage(key)` - Remove persisted state\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No middleware support\n- No devtools integration\n\n**Completeness:** 95% (state management complete)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (248 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/validation.ts` (56 lines)\n**Description:** Validation utilities for coordinates, numbers, and rulesets.\n\n**Implemented Functions:**\n- `isValidCoordinate(row, col, numRows, numCols)` - Validate grid coords\n- `clamp(value, min, max)` - Clamp value to range\n- `isInRange(value, min, max)` - Check if in range\n- `isPositiveNumber(value)` - Type guard for positive numbers\n- `isNonNegativeNumber(value)` - Type guard for non-negative numbers\n- `isInteger(value)` - Type guard for integers\n- `isValidRuleSet(ruleSet)` - Validate ruleset structure\n- `validateGridDimensions(rows, cols)` - Validate grid size\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No grid pattern validation\n- No cell age validation\n\n**Completeness:** 90% (validation utilities complete)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (191 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/logger.ts` (46 lines)\n**Description:** Singleton logger with timestamp formatting and log levels.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- `Logger` class (singleton pattern)\n- `debug(message, context)` - Debug logs (dev only)\n- `info(message, context)` - Info logs\n- `warn(message, context)` - Warning logs\n- `error(message, error, context)` - Error logs with stack trace in dev\n- Exported `logger` singleton instance\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No remote logging\n- No log persistence\n\n**Completeness:** 95% (logging complete for this use case)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Comprehensive (152 lines of tests)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/lib/canvasUtils.ts` (30 lines)\n**Description:** Canvas rendering utilities for cell colors and sizing.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- `getCellColor(age)` - Color based on cell age (cyan/magenta/purple)\n- `getCellBlur(age)` - Blur effect based on age\n- `getResponsiveCellSize()` - 18px mobile, 20px desktop\n- `CELL_CORNER_RADIUS` constant (2px)\n- `BACKGROUND_COLOR` (#0a0a0f)\n- `GRID_LINE_COLOR` (#1a1a2e)\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No color customization\n- No theme switching\n\n**Completeness:** 90% (canvas utilities complete)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Basic (75 lines in CanvasGrid.test.tsx)\n\n---\n\n### 3. COMPONENTS (`src/components/`)\n\n#### `src/components/CanvasGrid.tsx` (127 lines)\n**Description:** Canvas-based grid rendering component with responsive sizing and glow effects.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- Canvas rendering with high-DPR support\n- Grid line rendering (toggleable)\n- Cell rendering with age-based colors and blur effects\n- Rounded corners on cells\n- Responsive cell sizing\n- CSS variable for life intensity (--life-intensity)\n- Event handlers (onClick, onMouseMove, onMouseLeave)\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No animation/transition effects\n- No highlighting of clusters or patterns\n\n**Completeness:** 90% (rendering complete, animation missing)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Basic (75 lines for canvasUtils only)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/components/GridInteraction.tsx` (177 lines)\n**Description:** Interactive grid wrapper with hover highlighting and cursor management.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- Cell click handling (place/remove based on interactionMode)\n- Hover cell tracking and highlighting\n- Cursor management (default, crosshair, not-allowed)\n- Visual feedback for placeable/removable cells\n- Phase-based interaction locking\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No drag-to-paint\n- No multi-select\n- No undo/redo\n\n**Completeness:** 70% (basic interaction complete)\n\n**Test Coverage:** Basic (121 lines)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/components/Game.tsx` (156 lines)\n**Description:** Main game component with UI controls and state management.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- Grid preset selection (Small/Medium/Large)\n- Start/Clear/Random buttons\n- Show/Hide Grid toggle\n- Draw/Erase mode toggle\n- Phase display\n- Live cell count display\n- Flux display with color coding\n- Basic game state management\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No actual simulation running/timer logic\n- No countdown display\n- No level progression\n- No scoring system\n- No settings panel\n- No audio controls\n- No pattern library\n- No save/load patterns\n\n**Completeness:** 40% (UI skeleton complete, core gameplay missing)\n\n**Test Coverage:** None\n\n---\n\n### 4. OTHER FILES\n\n#### `src/App.tsx` (8 lines)\n**Description:** Root app component wrapper.\n\n**Completeness:** 100% (simple wrapper)\n\n**Test Coverage:** None found\n\n---\n\n#### `src/main.tsx` (11 lines)\n**Description:** React entry point with StrictMode.\n\n**Completeness:** 100%\n\n**Test Coverage:** None\n\n---\n\n#### `src/styles/index.css` (62 lines)\n**Description:** Global styles and CSS variables.\n\n**Implemented:**\n- Base font settings (Inter)\n- Body and root styling\n- Button styles with hover effects\n- Light/dark mode support (basic)\n\n**Missing Functionality:**\n- No custom component styles\n- No animations\n- No responsive design (basic only)\n\n**Completeness:** 50% (basic styles, needs more)\n\n---\n\n#### `src/vite-env.d.ts` (10 lines)\n**Description:** Vite type declarations.\n\n**Completeness:** 100%\n\n---\n\n#### `src/test/setup.ts` (29 lines)\n**Description:** Test setup with localStorage mock.\n\n**Completeness:** 100%\n\n---\n\n## SUMMARY BY DIRECTORY\n\n### src/lib/ - COMPLETE & WELL-TESTED\n| File | Lines | Tests | Completeness | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|--------------|-------|\n| simulation.ts | 138 | 322 | 95% | Core logic complete, missing advanced features |\n| phase.ts | 166 | 236 | 80% | Phase logic complete, not integrated |\n| flux.ts | 57 | 184 | 90% | Resource management complete |\n| interaction.ts | 60 | 97 | 70% | Basic interaction, missing drag/paint |\n| state.ts | 114 | 248 | 95% | State management complete |\n| validation.ts | 56 | 191 | 90% | Validation complete |\n| logger.ts | 46 | 152 | 95% | Logging complete |\n| canvasUtils.ts | 30 | 75 | 90% | Rendering utilities complete |\n\n### src/components/ - PARTIAL IMPLEMENTATION\n| File | Lines | Tests | Completeness | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|--------------|-------|\n| CanvasGrid.tsx | 127 | 75 | 90% | Rendering complete, no animations |\n| GridInteraction.tsx | 177 | 121 | 70% | Basic interaction, missing drag |\n| Game.tsx | 156 | 0 | 40% | UI skeleton, core gameplay missing |\n\n### src/types/ - TYPE DEFINITIONS ONLY\n| File | Lines | Tests | Completeness | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|--------------|-------|\n| index.ts | 110 | N/A | 100% | Complete, features not implemented |\n\n### src/styles/ - BASIC STYLES\n| File | Lines | Tests | Completeness | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|--------------|-------|\n| index.css | 62 | N/A | 50% | Basic styles, needs work |\n\n### src/hooks/ - NOT FOUND\n**Status:** Directory does not exist. Custom hooks are missing.\n\n---\n\n## MISSING FUNCTIONALITY (High Priority)\n\n1. **No src/hooks/ directory** - Missing custom hooks for game logic\n2. **Simulation timer not implemented** - Game doesn't actually run\n3. **No countdown display** - Phase countdown not shown\n4. **No scoring system** - Score tracking not implemented\n5. **No level progression** - Level system not implemented\n6. **No pattern cluster tracking** - Cell clustering not implemented\n7. **No drag-to-paint** - Only click interaction\n8. **No save/load patterns** - No pattern persistence\n9. **No settings UI** - Expert settings not exposed\n10. **No audio system** - Audio params defined but not used\n\n---\n\n## RECOMMENDATIONS\n\nThe codebase has excellent type definitions and well-tested core utilities. However, the game mechanics are incomplete. The main gap is between the solid foundation (lib/types) and the incomplete game implementation (components). Key missing pieces:\n\n1. Implement a `useGameLoop` hook to drive simulation\n2. Add countdown timer UI component\n3. Implement scoring and cluster tracking\n4. Create a pattern library and save/load system\n5. Build settings panel for expert configuration\n6. Add audio system integration\n7. Implement drag-to-paint interaction\n\nThe foundation is strong - now the game logic needs to be built on top of it.\n</task_result>","title":"Analyze implementation status","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39e1167dcffemiWZYyUcJM0KCN","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771169552415,"end":1771169636358}}}}
